  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Lantm&#xe4;teriet och Immovable Property Registration  Office(IPRO) twinning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lantm&#xe4;teriet/IPRO twinning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation between Swedish Lantmateriet and the Albanian Immovable   Property Registration Office, IPRO aims to develop business models    with the aim for IPRO to become self-financing organization through   cost recovery through fees for their services. Furthermore, the       Swedish National Land Survey assist and educate IPRO to take over     AlbPOS from military enoch the Geographical Institute.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbete mellan svenska och albanska lantm&#xe4;teriet (Immovable         Property Registration Office, IPRO) syftar till att utveckla          aff&#xe4;rsmodeller f&#xf6;r att IPRO skall bli sj&#xe4;lvfinansierande organisation genom kostnadst&#xe4;ckning med avgifter f&#xf6;r sina tj&#xe4;nster. Vidare skall   svenska Lantmateriet bist&#xe5; och utbilda IPRO att ta &#xf6;ver AlbPOS fr&#xe5;n   milit&#xe4;renoch det Geografiska Institutet.</narrative>
  </description>
